---
---

<section id="flow" class="py-24 lg:py-32 relative bg-brand-surface/40 border-t border-brand-border/40">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Title -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-teal/10 border border-brand-teal/30 text-brand-teal font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        30-Second Diagnostic Pipeline
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
        복잡한 검안 과정이<br />
        <span class="text-gradient-teal">단 3단계로 간결해집니다.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
        기존 15분 이상 소요되던 주관적 문진 방식을 벗어나, 30초 단일 촬영만으로 오차 없는 객관적 광학 수치를 도출합니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Step Process Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
      
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border border-brand-border/80 hover:border-brand-teal/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black font-display text-white/20 group-hover:text-brand-teal/40 transition-colors">01</span>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal/10 border border-brand-teal/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-teal">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"/>
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            30초 비접촉 촬영 센싱
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            사용자가 화면의 시표를 바라보는 동안, AI 비전 알고리즘이 얼굴 각도와 각막 반사점, 동공 반응을 실시간으로 자동 트래킹합니다.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>소요 시간</span>
          <span class="text-brand-teal font-bold">~ 30 SECONDS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border border-brand-border/80 hover:border-brand-teal/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black font-display text-white/20 group-hover:text-brand-teal/40 transition-colors">02</span>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-cyan">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            6차원 광학 신경망 분석
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            조절 지연치(Lag), 동공 수축률, 주시 불일치도, 안구 피로 지수 등 6가지 핵심 임상 데이터를 AI 모델이 정량적으로 분해 연산합니다.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>신경망 연산</span>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold">120K+ TRAINED</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border border-brand-border/80 hover:border-brand-teal/40 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-5xl font-black font-display text-white/20 group-hover:text-brand-teal/40 transition-colors">03</span>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-teal/10 border border-brand-teal/30 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-teal">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            맞춤 처방 리포트 자동 생성
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mb-6">
            개인의 고유한 생활 시거리(모니터, 스마트폰 등)에 가장 편안한 누진 다초점 최적 ADD 도수 및 렌즈 회랑 설계 가이드를 즉시 출력합니다.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-xs text-brand-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>처방 데이터 출력</span>
          <span class="text-brand-teal font-bold">INSTANT PDF / API</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
